<title>USA: Zeigler Coal says forms new EnerZ unit.</title>
<headline>Zeigler Coal says forms new EnerZ unit.</headline>
<dateline>FAIRVIEW HEIGHTS, Ill. 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zeigler Coal Holding Co said it formed a new unit, EnerZ Corp, which has filed with the U.S. Federal Energy Regulatory Commission for status as a wholesale power marketer.</p>
<p>The company expects to receive its approval from FERC later this fall, and to start doing business transactions shortly thereafter.</p>
<p>--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
